# S-044: conversion on delivery. A scaled input gets one of three rotating output buffers per frame; the callback
# receives the converted buffer (the cache frame is untouched). Fake scaler output: first two bytes of every plane are
# (input plane0 byte0 xor 0xff, number of scale calls on that scaler).
vopen v I420 30 1 16 8 3
vconnect v a 1 - NV12 16 8 DEFAULT DEFAULT
vconnect v b 2
vlock v 1 1 0x10
vunlock v
vlock v 1 2 0x20
vunlock v
vlock v 1 3 0x30
vunlock v
vlock v 1 4 0x40
vunlock v
vinputs v
# scale failure: warning logged, that input is skipped for this frame, other inputs still run
scaler scale fail
vlock v 1 5 0x50
vunlock v
scaler scale ok
vlock v 1 6 0x60
vunlock v
vinputs v
# disconnect destroys the scaler
vdisconnect v a 1
vclose v
